SUMMARY:SAPA Blue-Chip Auction
DESCRIPTION:SAPA's annual Blue-Chip Auction. Lots must have a catalog value of at least $20 (the opening bid may be lower). Members may submit up to 15 lots to a member of the Board of Governors by the November 6 meeting\, listing the catalog number\, catalog value\, catalog year\, condition\, and opening bid. Lots submitted on or after November 7 are accepted but may not be verified\; unverified lots are offered as is. Doors open at 6:30 PM\, auction begins at 7:30 PM.
LOCATION:MacArthur Park Lutheran Church\, Building 1\, 2903 Nacogdoches Road\, San Antonio\, TX 78217
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CATEGORIES:SAPA,Meeting
END:VEVENT
END:VCALENDAR
